  "details": "When I use Ovrtoolkit while calibrating my FBT, it often happens for many other people that my nameplate is either in the ground, inside my avatar or somewhere in the air, also sometimes my voice location is somewhere random. While recalibration, it can even sometimes happen if i have OVRToolkit open, that i completely disappear for some people, this can only be fixed, if they hide and show me again. Without using ovrtoolkit, everything works fine.  Also so dislocated nameplates by some other people, so it seem to be not a single problem isolated to me.",
